Abstract: Working draft of DASH-IF IOP v5 Part 3, covering requirements and recommendations for DASH on-demand services. Drafted from DASH-IF IOP v4.3 on-demand service text and aligned with IOP v5 Part 2.

!Issue Tracking: <a href="https://github.com/Dash-Industry-Forum/IOPv5/issues?q=is%3Aopen+project%3ADash-Industry-Forum%2F29" target="_blank">Currently open Part 3 issues</a><br><a href="https://github.com/Dash-Industry-Forum/IOPv5/issues/new?title=%5BPart+3%5D%3A+" target="_blank">File a new Part 3 issue</a> (then assign to <a href="https://github.com/orgs/Dash-Industry-Forum/projects/29" target="_blank">Part 3 project</a>)
!Document Status: <strong>Working Draft 0.1</strong>. Note: See <a href="https://dashif.org/Guidelines/iop-v5/part01-overview.html#document-status">Annex A: Document Status</a> for versioning and workflow.
!Contributors: Contributors are maintained via GitHub pull requests to the <a href="https://github.com/Dash-Industry-Forum/IOPv5">IOPv5 repository</a>.
!Contributing: See <a href="https://dashif.org/Guidelines/iop-v5/part01-overview.html#contributing">Part 1 §1.4 Contributing and Reviewing</a>.
!Key Words: On-Demand, Static, DASH, CMAF, Segment Index, Indexed Self-Initializing Media Segment
